      {
        "title": "Inscribed angle",
        "body": "The angle $x$ at the vertex is an inscribed angle that subtends the arc between the two other end points of the chords, which consists of 2 sides of the octagon. Each side subtends $\\frac{360^\\circ}{8}=45^\\circ$ at the centre, so the arc is $90^\\circ$ and $x=\\frac{90^\\circ}{2}=45^\\circ$.\n\n**Answer: (C) 45**"
