        "text": "56"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "E",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Use the dimensions",
        "body": "Let $AB=l$ and $BC=w$. Then $AE=\\frac l2$ and the height from F to AB is $BF=\\frac w2$, so the area of $\\triangle AEF=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac l2\\cdot\\frac w2=\\frac{lw}8=7$ and $lw=56$.\n\n**Answer: (E) 56**"
      }
